    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 850000.
    spendable expects answers [].

scenario flip_now is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
    % nothing signed, no delay passed
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 850000.
    flip_spend expects changes [["add: the witness contains a signature by the revocation key"]].

scenario flip_after_delays is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
    % nothing signed, every delay passed
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 851008.
    flip_spend expects changes [["add: the witness contains a signature by the local node"], ["add: the witness contains a signature by the revocation key"]].

scenario lost_the_revocation_key is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
    % the key of the revocation key lost, everything else given
    the witness contains a signature by the local node.
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 851008.
    spendable expects answers ["the coin can be spent"].
    flip_block expects changes [["remove: the coin was confirmed in block 850000"], ["remove: the spending transaction is in block 851008"], ["remove: the witness contains a signature by the local node"]].

scenario lost_the_local_node is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
    % the key of the local node lost, everything else given
    the witness contains a signature by the revocation key.
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 851008.
    spendable expects answers ["the coin can be spent"].
    flip_block expects changes [["remove: the witness contains a signature by the revocation key"]].

