scenario chain_revocation is, as stated in the Tape run of 2026-09-14 at transaction 440b71b3436c7b9621c0d8c9d06536fd0fd48a3fff06ff66b46376f62073a4d0:
    % the chain accepted the spend: transaction 440b71b3436c7b9621c0d8c9d06536fd0fd48a3fff06ff66b46376f62073a4d0
    the witness contains a signature by the revocation key.
